<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B><I>Recent Corporate Update</I></B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The Company completed the merger with VYNE Therapeutics Inc. (the &ldquo;Merger&rdquo;),
closed the previously announced private financings that resulted in gross proceeds totaling approximately $200 million, and began trading
